  "ALL_TEXT": "95 EXT. MORTUARY ROAD - DAY \nANTHONY leaves the mortuary, where VEDA, GOVARDHAN and \nSULOCHANA are waiting, and soon pursue him. ANTHONY senses he \nis being followed, and starts walking at a brisker pace. He \nwalks through a door, VEDA follows. ANTHONY takes a blind \nturn, and VEDA loses him for a second. \nVEDA then picks up the pace, to turn into a wall, unable to \nfigure out where ANTHONY has gone. ANTHONY looks at VEDA from \na vantage, and recognizes him. VEDA also spots him though, \nand ANTHONY runs off. The trio chase after him through the \nnarrow by-lanes. \nSULOCHANA \nVEDA aagu \nVEDA \n(turns around) \nEnti \nSULOCHANA \nSandhulu, gondhulu \nthiruguthunnam...thirigettappudu \ndhaari confuse avuthaam \nShe picks up a brick and draws arrows for directions. \nUnbeknownst to them, the trio are being followed by the \nFOREST Minister\u2019s goons. The chase intensifies - ANTHONY is \nbeing chased by the trio, who are being chased by the goons. \nANTHONY \n(while running) \nRei, mimmalni kuda pudchesta \nemankuntunaro? \nVEDA \nenti ra mortuary lo pani chesi \nchesi pudchadam alavaatu \naypoyindha? Mundhu doriki saavu ila \njinka la parigethuthu unte navalla \nkaadhu... \nVEDA gets a call. He pulls his phone from his pocket, \npanting. SULOCHANA snatches the phone and answers \nSULOCHANA \nHello \nKENNEL OWNER (O.S.) \nAa udhyogam leni sir leera amma? \nSULOCHANA \nUnnaaru, parigetthi parigetthi \naavesapadutunnaaru..em kaavalo \ncheppu... \nKENNEL OWNER (O.S.) \nEm ledu, ee roju aa kukka ni mating \nki teesko vastaanu ani 1,500 \nteeskunnaaru. Eppudu vastaarani \nadagadaaniki phone chesaanu \nVEDA hears this and snatches the phone back. \nVEDA \nSir, ippudu chaala kashtam aina \nparisthithi lo unnaam...taravaata \nphone chesta \nSULOCHANA \nAsalu siggu anedidhi ledha? Entha \ndabbu lekapothe illa kukka sperm ni \nammi bathukedaamani decide \nayyavaa... \nVEDA \nBha ippudu adha important...manamu \nippudu Usain Bolt laaga \nparagettaledante mundunna aadu \ndorakaka venekunna veellaki \ndorikipotaam. \nThe chase continues till the goons stops. \nASSISTANT GOON \nAnna, emdanna, godadhaggare unnaaru \nkadha \nLEAD GOON \nNe abba, paina chudu \nThe camera tilts up to show police station sign \nASSISTANT GOON \nPolice aa anna, vallu police \nstation ki elte lock aipotaaru \nLEAD GOON \nSare, em jaruguddo chuddam \nCUT TO:",
